  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The days of the week",
     "texto": [
      "From Monday to Friday the days are **numbered**: Monday is the «second day» (**segunda-feira**) and Friday the «sixth» (**sexta-feira**). Sábado and domingo have their own names, not numbers.",
      "For a specific day: **na** segunda-feira (on Monday). For something regular: **à** segunda-feira or **ao** sábado (on Mondays, on Saturdays).",
      "**O fim de semana** = the weekend."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
